#The monthly values of the solar-modulation potential phi (in MV) for the
#2026 default (Ghelfi-Maurin-Derome) parameter set. Reconstructed from
#CRDB rest_phi (force-field) using neutron-monitor stations OULU, KERG, NEWK,
#weekly series averaged to monthly means (the same series the 2026 fit used).
#References:
#[1] Ghelfi, Maurin, Derome et al., Adv. Space Res. 60 (2017) 833 [Ghelfi:2016pcv];
#    CRDB rest_phi https://lpsc.in2p3.fr/crdb .
#[2] Maurin, Melot, Taillet, A&A 569 (2014) A32 (CRDB).
#Format: Year followed by 12 monthly phi values [MV]. NaN gaps filled by year mean.
#Year   Jan   Feb   Mar   Apr   May   Jun   Jul   Aug   Sep   Oct   Nov   Dec
#++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
